  - m_Id: 215229878272
    m_Localized: Miasm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2413976309760
    m_Localized: "Select a unit, then cast the spell and send a stream of Kuroy\u016B
      toward it. If the unit is an ally, it becomes harder and gains X% PDef for
      3 turns. If the unit is an enemy, its PDef is reduced by X% and it takes magical
      damage for 3 rounds.\n\n\n\nX = 0.1 + (1 - (MP / 100))"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2450995236864
    m_Localized: "Spread a Kuroy\u016B area across the battlefield, affecting the
      Allied units; the mid unit moves forward 1 turn, while the left and right enemy
      units each move back 1 turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2619652395008
    m_Localized: "Renjiro transforms the battlefield, enveloping it in his Kuroy\u016B.
      For 2 rounds, Allied Units regain 15 SP per turn, and their damage increases
      by 15%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
